Recommends: initramfs-tools | dracut-core
Description: install Qualcomm ath11k/ath12k board data from Windows
 Extracts the board-data filename selected by a Windows Qualcomm Wi-Fi
 driver, finds the corresponding BDF in the Windows DriverStore, and adds it
 to the Linux ath11k or ath12k board-2.bin firmware container.
 .
 Windows and BitLocker volumes are accessed read-only. Generated firmware is
 installed as a local overlay without replacing package-owned firmware.
